  "contentHtml": "<p>I will be doing a Conversation with him, most of all about his new and very good book <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cauldron-Making-Modern-Middle-East/dp/0593805054/ref=sr_1_1?crid=15K0SWKH4DCDD&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.nXTABoITW3biOlAy1WBbC-6LfoOuxZzeXHyKqurTvslbvwpOScQ0XCDuUfG4JXqdE8rM0wx3q6OiSmLu3RSnxZLT_HQEAqHtvZIUq262UuJ1CB5bwKfKxojZsvCzvoWd2-hONdraQAopBQqu-I7i-VKVXh7Un2muPMcGQtIICtpUSZjkB4yWuUHMTIVQm55rjCK80BidJ0Lx0WV6OR5WlIGJEMr1gSHNusCm3RKFT-c.BlKh-mMUUjDdkzXRh3mDRoAtBvT_oU9_4uAIdtPowAM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=simon+sebag+montefiore+books&amp;qid=1794405150&amp;sprefix=simon+se%2Caps%2C159&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Cauldron: The Making of the Modern Middle East</a>.&nbsp; He has <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/s?k=simon+sebag+montefiore+books&amp;crid=15K0SWKH4DCDD&amp;sprefix=simon+se%2Caps%2C159&amp;ref=nb_sb_ss_p13n-expert-pd-ops-ranker_1_8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">many other excellent books too</a>, including on Russian history and some fiction.&nbsp; Here is <a href=\"https://www.weidenfeldandnicolson.co.uk/contributor/simon-sebag-montefiore/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">his home page</a>, here is <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simon_Sebag_Montefiore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">his Wikipedia page</a>.</p>\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>",
